(17) Prisoners who have pending cases (other than their criminal appeals pending against their conviction).
(iii)That their cases should not come under section 435 of the Code of Criminal Procedure;
(iv) That there is safety for the prisoner's life, if released;
(v) That the prisoner will be accepted by the https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis members of their family;
