It is clear as day light that impugned G.O. has been made on the basis that prison inmate has not completed 14 years whereas completion of ten years will suffice as regards G.O.(Ms)
No.488, Home (Prison.IV) Department, dated 15.11.2021 vide paragraph 2(A) which has been extracted and reproduced supra.
In other words, the impugned G.O. has been made on the erroneous assumption that premature release plea is predicated on G.O.(Ms) No.64 Home (Prison-IV) Department dated 01.02.2018 which prescribes minimum 14 years of sentence as the requirement to be eligible for being considered for premature release.
